@function SpawnOutdoorLevelPreset
@address Game.exe.ram:00674730
@date 2026.09.05
@calling __fastcall
@description Outdoor DRLG preset placement that tries cells in a fully randomized order: builds a shuffle table of every interior grid cell, Fisher-Yates-shuffles it using pLevel->sSeed, then walks the shuffled cells calling TestOutdoorLevelPreset and, on the first cell that passes, calls SpawnOutdoorLevelPresetEx and returns TRUE. Returns FALSE if no cell is valid. Mutates pLevel->sSeed. Contrast with SpawnPresetFarAway which picks the farthest valid cell instead of the first random one.

